= Fundamentals of Biomedical Instrumentation
== What is Biomedical Engineering?
It is a cross disciplinary field that incorporates engineering,biology,chemistry and medicine to develop technologies and devices that improve healthcare and medical practices.

== What is Biomedical Instrumentation?
Biomedical Instrumentation is the field of engineering that focuses to create and develop instruments and devices used to take measurements that are used in monitoring, diagnostic means and therapy.